5,0,1,talk,Takumi,,I am Takumi. I will find the werewolf and protect my friends. Let us begin.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,George,,I am George. I will observe carefully and speak when I have something useful to say. Let us proceed calmly.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Yumi,,Hi everyone! I'm Yumi. I'm really excited to meet you all! Let's have a great time together and find the wolf!,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Misaki,,"Hello, I am Misaki. I will keep my observations to myself for now. Let us see how the day unfolds.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Rin,,Hi! I'm Rin! I'm so excited to be here. I promise to be super careful and help everyone find the bad guy!,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Yumi, your energy is great. @Misaki, why are you so quiet? We need to trust each other to survive.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,George,,"@Misaki, silence is a valid strategy. I will not pressure you. Let us all remain calm and observe the dynamics.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
