15,0,3,talk,Takumi,,"@George, I respect your calmness. But we cannot just wait. @Rin, your enthusiasm is good, but stay sharp.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""George"",""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,George,,"@Takumi, I appreciate the concern. Patience is a virtue. We must let the night reveal its secrets before acting rashly.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
