31,1,1,talk,Takumi,,I have confirmed George is human. The rest of you are suspects. Who will speak first?,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,George,,"I am relieved to be cleared. Thank you, Takumi. Now we must find the true threat among the remaining four.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
